+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/order/facade/OrderFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Preserved counts/pages for empty pages and populated list metadata. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/repositories/order/OrderRepository.java` | modified | Made historical order associations optional and de-duplicated detail results. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/repositories/order/OrderRepositoryImpl.java` | modified | Preserved zero-match totals, de-duplicated list results, and grouped OR filters. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/utils/RepositoryHelper.java` | modified | Corrected ceiling page-count calculation. |
+| `sm-core-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/model/common/EntityList.java` | modified | Exposed the calculated page count, including zero pages. |
+| `sm-core/src/test/java/com/salesmanager/test/business/utils/RepositoryHelperTest.java` | added test | Pins down zero-based offsets, ceiling page counts, and empty totals. |
